# global-arret: Does `arret=1` in a global action list stop the run (XPPAUT 8.2.2)?
# xpp: rows=6
# pc: ok
# ruling: pc-ode accepts `arret` and `out_put` as undeclared global targets. The model is simulation only, so pc-ir refuses it with SimulationOnly (language.md, Statement details).
x'=1
x(0)=0
aux v=x
global 1 x-0.55 {arret=1}
@ total=2,dt=0.1,meth=euler
